To ensure the Nokia 7750 SR honors link-bandwidth extended communities during BGP-based load balancing and maintains accurate bandwidth attributes when redistributing IPv4 prefixes internally with next-hop-self, use the following configuration:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "JUNIPER_PEERS"
        link-bandwidth
            aggregate-used-paths ipv4
        exit
    exit
