- The `no extended-nh-encoding` command hardcodes the session to basic IPv4 by suppressing capability advertisements for advanced features.
- Restricting the `family` to `ipv4` ensures only standard IPv4 routes are exchanged.
- Static neighbor configuration eliminates dynamic session negotiations. 

