- The `hold-time 90` sets the BGP session keepalive interval to 90 seconds.  
- The `min 90` enforces the peer's proposed hold-time must be at least 90 seconds, preventing aggressive negotiation.  
- Apply this at the neighbor level for targeted peers or adjust the context (`config>router>bgp` or `group`) for broader application.  

