```

**Adjustment Guidance**:
- Increase `reuse`/reduce `half-life` further if stable paths still experience delays.
- Lower `suppress`/extend `max-suppress-time` if unstable routes persist.
- Monitor flap counts via `show router bgp routes damping` to fine-tune thresholds.
