To configure the Nokia 7750 SR router for BGP route reflection with `192.168.100.1` as the primary loopback endpoint:

```console
configure router bgp optimal-route-reflection
    location 1 primary-ip-address 192.168.100.1
exit
configure router bgp
    cluster <cluster-id> orr-location 1
exit
```

**Key notes for implementation:**
1. Replace `<cluster-id>` with your actual BGP cluster identifier (e.g., router ID or custom value)
