To adjust the next-hop resolution for labeled BGP routes over transport tunnels on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure the resolution filters to include both `sr-te` and `sr-ospf` tunnel types. This ensures the router validates reachability using Segment Routing tunnels programmed by either TE or OSPF instances, aligning with your existing tunnel configurations.

