To implement extended BGP graceful restart functionality on a Nokia 7750 SR router for maintaining session stability and preserving forwarding state during control plane upgrades, use the following CLI configuration commands. These enable graceful restart helper mode to retain routes and forwarding states for restarting peers beyond standard timers:

```cli
configure router bgp
