To ensure your Nokia 7750 SR routers advertise all active IPv4 paths to downstream peers via BGP while maintaining optimal convergence times, create a route policy named "core_routes" and apply it to BGP. Use the following CLI configuration commands:

```cli
configure router policy-options
begin
policy-statement "core_routes"
    entry 10
        from protocol direct
        action accept
    exit
    entry 20
        from protocol static
        action accept
    exit
    entry 30
        from protocol ospf
        action accept
    exit
    entry 40
        from protocol isis
        action accept
    exit
commit
exit
```

```cli
configure router bgp
    export "core_routes"
    family ipv4
    group "downstream_peers"
        family ipv4
        peer-as <peer_AS_number>
        neighbor <peer_IP_address>
    exit
exit
```

