exit
```

**Important considerations for stability and peer continuity:**
1. **Hold-Time Adjustment:** The default hold-time (90 seconds) must exceed the keepalive interval. If your WAN latency requires longer failure detection, increase the hold-time to at least **180 seconds** (3x the keepalive) using:
   ```cli
